@ 0 7 0 00691563a92a0cf21a5ecc641dd2e7f3
+         row  `Unexpected(message)`  2  _the server sent an unexpected message `message`_  包括 `SSH_MSG_UNIMPLEMENTED` 的 `3`：服务器不理解这个客户端发送的某些内容
+         row  `NoCommonAlgorithm(kind)`  3  _the server offers no supported `kind` algorithm_  `key exchange`、`host key` 或 `cipher`
+         row  `HostKeyRejected(keyType)`  4  _the server's `keyType` host key was not accepted_  `Ssh.HostKeys` 方针拒绝了该密钥
+         row  `BadSignature`  5  _the server's signature over the exchange is wrong_  主机密钥对交换哈希的签名验证失败
+         row  `Disconnected(code, text)`  6  _the server disconnected with code `code`: `text`_  服务器发送了 `SSH_MSG_DISCONNECT`
+         row  `ClosedConnection`  7  _the connection was closed_  套接字在消息中途关闭
+         row  `Integrity`  8  _a packet failed its integrity check_  其 AEAD 检查

