+         row  `Unauthenticated(methods)`  10  _no identity was accepted; allowed: `methods`_  没有签名者被接受；方法是服务器所允许的那些，`publickey` 或 `publickey,password`
+         row  `Agent(detail)`  11  _the SSH agent `detail`_  无法访问 `ssh-agent`，或它没有列出其密钥，或拒绝签名
+         row  `ChannelRefused(detail)`  12  _the server refused to open a channel: `detail`_  会话通道
+         row  `RequestRefused(kind)`  13  _the server refused the `kind` request_  `exec` 请求
+         row  `Unreachable(reason)`  14  _the server could not be reached: `reason`_  无法建立 TCP 连接；携带 `Socket.Error.Reason`

